---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Affiliate Disclosure — AICost Matrix" description="Affiliate and advertising disclosure for aicost.apexcraftweb.com" canonical="https://aicost.apexcraftweb.com/disclosure">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 prose prose-slate">
    <h1>Affiliate & Advertising Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500">Last updated: November 2026</p>
    <p>Provider links in this release are ordinary reference links. This release includes no affiliate checkout links or advertising scripts in the application code.</p>
    <p>Previous statements naming affiliate partners were not supported by verified partnership records and have been removed. No partnership or revenue is claimed here.</p>
    <p>Price coverage is limited and manually checked. See <a href="/methodology">sources and methodology</a>. No paid handbook is available.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
